tps://si.imgix.net/570578f0/uploads/origins/e37606c9-4b17-4ce4-84b5-7ebf602cd22c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6def2427dff4631469870fb993d6fb00 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@megane_otoko/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8bd4c32/uploads/origins/e1e35286-ab64-4f01-82d9-32c6ea960a21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a0bee6def6391eccbf015a41138705c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8bd4c32/uploads/origins/e1e35286-ab64-4f01-82d9-32c6ea960a21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a0bee6def6391eccbf015a41138705c, https://si.imgix.net/f8bd4c32/uploads/origins/e1e35286-ab64-4f01-82d9-32c6ea960a21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ef91aa45a69476e46c423bbb4d6f534 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8bd4c32/uploads/origins/e1e35286-ab64-4f01-82d9-32c6ea960a21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5356bae54f893961f0065196b8c00896 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello once again! I'm sending another request for you to draw my VTuber character, but this time she is an elf instead of a cat. The updated reference sheet is at the link below - as usual, most details are yours to pick regarding pose and expression, but if possible could you draw her with either a Hitbox controller or standing at an Arcade Cabinet?\n\nThank you as always!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1-B2UGHPWDxAg3c4xpQ4gSfGPRhe4TkUi/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@megane_otoko/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ec7a2c1/uploads/origins/e023e267-5c0b-4dd0-b441-3de62377a890?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6b495075a78ba38bccdb5aa71a9fdad", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7ec7a2c1/uploads/origins/e023e267-5c0b-4dd0-b441-3de62377a890?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6b495075a78ba38bccdb5aa71a9fdad, https://si.imgix.net/7ec7a2c1/uploads/origins/e023e267-5c0b-4dd0-b441-3de62377a890?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e19eeb35a22270de66daa0afedf7ec49 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7ec7a2c1/uploads/origins/e023e267-5c0b-4dd0-b441-3de62377a890?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01cdaea5955befa8754925b3f7c681cf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! I am approaching you for another request of my VTuber character, since I love how you draw her.\n\nThis time, could you please draw her wearing the Track Suit from Street Fighter V? Specifically Color 5, in the style that Karin and Poison wear it (with the shirt zipped down). I would like if she looked exhausted, as if she just finished a fight, and was holding a metal bat.\n\nReference pictures for the track suits and the character are in the link provided. Thank you as always!\n\nhttps://ibb.co/album/wBPFW6", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@megane_otoko/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1f64335c/uploads/origins/a23de01e-88c4-4bc5-b678-a0d495ea2a79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e4a4e0db0321e3bccf488207319390a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1f64335c/uploads/origins/a23de01e-88c4-4bc5-b678-a0d495ea2a79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e4a4e0db0321e3bccf488207319390a, https://si.imgix.net/1f64335c/uploads/origins/a23de01e-88c4-4bc5-b678-a0d495ea2a79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b59637d54e047db9d2cc3b8536d629fd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1f64335c/uploads/origins/a23de01e-88c4-4bc5-b678-a0d495ea2a79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce61665c128a18ddd5d0cb24528c73f1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ボッティチェリの「ヴィーナスの誕生」をモチーフにした「ストリートファイター」の「ローズの誕生」です。\n楽しい作品になるはずです。\n\nhttps://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/085e865a-ed98-4e1f-9d90-cb6898c1449f_1.c5115e3dc9110ff4d12ab6bc2eed310b.jpeg?odnHeight=612&odnWidth=612&odnBg=FFFFFF", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@megane_otoko/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb1a531f/uploads/origins/fe3afe77-8a5e-4cd2-94d3-1bff2ffcc3a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3acd172e94a6c64d80088a713f6ac1d6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb1a531f/uploads/origins/fe3afe77-8a5e-4cd2-94d3-1bff2ffcc3a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3acd172e94a6c64d80088a713f6ac1d6, https://si.imgix.net/cb1a531f/uploads/origins/fe3afe77-8a5e-4cd2-94d3-1bff2ffcc3a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88d9aeadfbf43bda5d8373122da61b42 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb1a531f/uploads/origins/fe3afe77-8a5e-4cd2-94d3-1bff2ffcc3a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=899129d1823c11b3f1107257c1bb2fb3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは。メナトが水晶玉の魔法で誤ってローズに変身してしまった絵をお願いできればと思います。髪の色や肌の色はメナトに合わせたまま、それ以外は完全にローズに見えるようにしてほしいです。  衣装は水着かランジェリーでいいので、驚いた顔をしてほしいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@megane_otoko/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc493fed/uploads/origins/3034577e-60b5-423b-9f86-1d99e9f67fdb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80d142e7484d5a8f6d0dd2b000a1d1b6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cc493fed/uploads/origins/3034577e-60b5-423b-9f86-1d99e9f67fdb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80d142e7484d5a8f6d0dd2b000a1d1b6, https://si.imgix.net/cc493fed/uploads/origins/3034577e-60b5-423b-9f86-1d99e9f67fdb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7774dcd52956e7ce6c5c27c7e3193db9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cc493fed/uploads/origins/3034577e-60b5-423b-9f86-1d99e9f67fdb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b89c0db05158165c243418b2137ff8c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ストリートファイターローズの雰囲気になっているので、バーレスクローズ。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@megane_otoko/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d09a3a34/uploads/origins/0f9021f3-a977-4599-851c-f9e47b26937f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2d8087743539d7a1a890fe3904a7688", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d09a3a34/uploads/origins/0f9021f3-a977-4599-851c-f9e47b26937f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2d8087743539d7a1a890fe3904a7688, https://si.imgix.net/d09a3a34/uploads/origins/0f9021f3-a977-4599-851c-f9e47b26937f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c77f2ce7780b4df82a4a6d6c43320bb4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d09a3a34/uploads/origins/0f9021f3-a977-4599-851c-f9e47b26937f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e50479a226e9a0fbc0e86e3e0ccd04ac 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。今回はストリートファイターVのGとデッドライジングやマーベルVsカプコン3のフランク・ウェストのアートワークをお願いします。 具体的には、Gはストーリーカラー09、フランク・ウェストはカラー2でお願いします。以下のURLに参考資料を添付しています。ポーズや設定は自由ですが、パートナーや友人としての交流をお願いします。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/rikareadman/status/1459595583467835392?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@megane_otoko/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/838956b1/uploads/origins/7c89da34-8ed3-4aaf-bae1-b47a9e8664f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87fdbec22d225853ecd43bcadac13979", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/838956b1/uploads/origins/7c89da34-8ed3-4aaf-bae1-b47a9e8664f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=to